# Email Check Template

## Purpose
Template for checking unread count across multiple accounts.

## Usage
```bash
osascript check_unread.scpt
```

## Script Variables
- `targetAccount`: Replace with your account name (e.g., "iCloud", "Gmail").
- `mailboxName`: Usually "Inbox".

## Example
For Outlook/Exchange:
```bash
osascript -e 'tell application "Mail" to get count of messages of mailbox "Inbox" of account "Exchange"'
```